@startuml extract-method-before-after
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam RoundCorner 8
skinparam ClassBorderThickness 2

title Extract Method -- Before vs After

skinparam package {
    BorderThickness 2
}

package "BEFORE (Monolithic)" as before #FFF3F3 {
    skinparam ClassBackgroundColor<<before>> #FDEDEC
    skinparam ClassBorderColor<<before>> #E74C3C
    skinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor<<before>> #E74C3C
    skinparam ClassFontColor<<before>> #2C3E50

    class "Order" as OrderBefore <<before>> {
        - name : String
        - items : List<LineItem>
        __
        + printOwing() : void
        ....
        <color:#E74C3C>// print banner</color>
        <color:#E74C3C>// calculate outstanding</color>
        <color:#E74C3C>// print details</color>
        <color:#E74C3C>// ALL in one long method!</color>
    }
}

note bottom of before
  <color:#E74C3C><b>Problem:</b></color>
  printOwing() does 3 things:
  1. Print banner
  2. Calculate outstanding
  3. Print details
  All tangled in one method
end note

package "AFTER (Decomposed)" as after #F0FFF0 {
    skinparam ClassBackgroundColor<<after>> #EAFAF1
    skinparam ClassBorderColor<<after>> #27AE60
    skinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor<<after>> #27AE60
    skinparam ClassFontColor<<after>> #2C3E50

    class "Order" as OrderAfter <<after>> {
        - name : String
        - items : List<LineItem>
        __
        + printOwing() : void
        - printBanner() : void
        - calculateOutstanding() : double
        - printDetails(outstanding : double) : void
    }
}

note bottom of after
  <color:#27AE60><b>Solution:</b></color>
  printOwing() delegates to
  3 focused, named methods.
  Each method has a single purpose.
end note

before -[hidden]right-> after

note as arrow
  <b>Refactoring</b>
  ====
  Extract each section
  into its own method
  with a descriptive name
end note

OrderBefore .. arrow
arrow .. OrderAfter

@enduml
